ke to  look at I call aspirational mentors  these are people who you look up to but  they have nothing to do with your  business so maybe really like Richard  Branson maybe really like Oprah Winfrey  maybe really like Donald Trump whoever  it is look at Richard Branson how we got  started how he promotes his business  even though you may have nothing to do  with the airline business or the music  industry that he was involved in you're  doing something completely different you  can still learn from his success  how he markets his business those  lessons are still applicable to your  company you just have to find out how to  do it so look at these guys look at how  they got started read their biographies  again you can't compete with virgin  right now you can't look at what they're  doing right now because it's way too big  look at how Richard Branson got started  read his biography look online there's  tons of stories we have a lot on our  website as well look at how they got  started and grew their business and  there's lessons there that you can learn  and directly apply to your company again  the fastest way to accomplish any goal  to grow your business or whatever it is  business or personal the fastest way to  accomplish it is to model success  instead of trying to figure everything  out yourself find someone who's already  done it and apply their lessons to what  you're going through right now it'll  make a huge impact on your business and  your life I guarantee it for those of  you watching if you like the video  please give it a thumbs up below if you  have a comment or if you agree with what  I say or disagree for some reason feel  free to leave it in the comment section  below I always read those I always check  them out thank you great question  Raymond and I'll see you guys on the  next episode  you
 

